ademy-id "q-50041" :question/problem "Given that \n\n$$\n\\frac{3{x}^{2}+x+1}{{x}^{2}(x+1)}=\\frac{A}{x}+\\frac{B}{{x}^{2}}+\\frac{C}{x+1},\n$$\n\nwhere $A$, $B$, and $C$ are real constants, determine the value of $A\\cdot B\\cdot C.$" :question/worked-solution "Multiplying both sides of the given equality by ${x}^{2}(x+1)$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{x}^{2}+x+1 & =Ax(x+1)+B(x+1)+C{x}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLetting $x=0$  gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3(0)^{2}+0+1 & =A(0)(0+1)+B(0+1)+C(0)^{2} \\\\ B & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLetting $x=-1$  gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3(-1)^{2}+(-1)+1 & =A(-1)(-1+1)+B(-1+1)+C(-1)^{2} \\\\ C & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, letting $x=1$ and using our values for $B$ and $C$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3(1)^{2}+1+1 & =A(1)(1+1)+(1)(1+1)+(3)(1)^{2} \\\\ 5 & =2A+2+3 \\\\ 5 & =2A+5 \\\\ A & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n  \n\nHence,\n\n$$\nA\\cdot B\\cdot C=0\\cdot 1\\cdot 3=0.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-50041/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "c30dc350-d0c9-5a4d-87a0-4e2ebb1bb221"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-50041"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-70011/selection/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490" :answer/id #uuid "76eafc7c-164d-5ac2-91c8-5ff034d6092e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70011/selection/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" :answer/id #uuid "ebe63480-3758-55f1-b6cd-8f28527c0a27" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70011/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "c30d38ff-08c3-56b9-8ca9-40e322607c25" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70011/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "a8fc1ad3-ffc0-5e69-a2d2-8bfe294c2b4d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70011/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "cf6fd773-17da-5617-b5b6-9b1a1f9ac508" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70011/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "2328cd00-6281-5b62-8c32-00dbf60032f8" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-70011/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer-field/choices ["q-70011/selection/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490" "q-70011/selection/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" "q-70011/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" "q-70011/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" "q-70011/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-70011" :question/id #uuid "2ac72bfe-dd66-56f2-82a3-114a24a5422c" :question/math-academy-id "q-70011" :question/problem "Given that\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}+x+1}{{x}^{3}(x+1)}=\\frac{A}{x}+\\frac{B}{{x}^{2}}+\\frac{C}{{x}^{3}}+\\frac{D}{x+1},\n$$\n\nwhere $A$, $B$, $C$ and $D$ are real constants, determine the value of $AB-CD.$" :question/worked-solution "Multiplying both sides of the given equality by ${x}^{3}(x+1)$ gives\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}+x+1=A{x}^{2}(x+1)+Bx(x+1)+C(x+1)+D{x}^{3}.\n$$\n\nLetting $x=-1$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(-1)^{2}+(-1)+1 & =A(-1)^{2}(-1+1)+B(-1)(-1+1)+C(-1+1)+D(-1)^{3} \\\\ 1-1+1 & =-D \\\\ 1 & =-D \\\\ D & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLetting $x=0$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{0}^{2}+0+1 & =A(0)^{2}(0+1)+B(0)(0+1)+C(0+1)+D(0)^{3} \\\\ 1 & =C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLetting $x=1$ and using our values for $C$ and $D$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{1}^{2}+1+1 & =A(1)^{2}(1+1)+B(1)(1+1)+1(1+1)+(-1)(1)^{3} \\\\ 1+1+1 & =2A+2B+2-1 \\\\ 2B & =2-2A \\\\ B & =1-A.\\,\\,(1)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, letting $x=2$ and using our values for $C$ and $D$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{2}^{2}+2+1 & =A(2)^{2}(2+1)+B(2)(2+1)+1(2+1)+(-1)(2)^{3} \\\\ 4+2+1 & =12A+6B+3-8 \\\\ 6B & =12-12A \\\\ B & =2-2A.\\,\\,(2)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom $(1)$ and $(2)$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1-A & =2-2A \\\\ A & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow we substitute the value of $A$ into $(1)$  to get the value of $B:$\n\n$$\nB=1-1=0\n$$\n\nFinally,\n\n$$\nAB-CD=1(0)-1(-1)=1.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-70011/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9e9c4ef2-0491-5b42-8679-4fe7dfbd7b00"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-70011"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-73382/selection/0f0db3a18f1d79c4863315eefe754cc5306e04e7aeebf4414ffedb95d6f1bc97" :answer/id #uuid "2b2e5f18-b0ca-53f1-b205-b8b3e0fa2b75" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73382/selection/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473" :answer/id #uuid "2fba6fe7-409c-5d6f-9297-733fac14caac" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73382/selection/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af" :answer/id #uuid "94728084-791a-53ed-bc6c-bcda1b0b8205" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73382/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "417051fb-bf5d-5d89-981e-db73d2e3a700" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73382/selection/5d022a88a643e97abec4d01dfce48411101475c0705a98f29f3a8e3560fb0616" :answer/id #uuid "b91840f3-974c-5f5d-b674-48ea93006ac3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73382/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "bf9c7773-54f1-5c3c-bd8f-b3d8d36bf895" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-73382/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer-field/choices ["q-73382/selection/0f0db3a18f1d79c4863315eefe754cc5306e04e7aeebf4414ffedb95d6f1bc97" "q-73382/selection/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473" "q-73382/selection/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af" "q-73382/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" "q-73382/selection/5d022a88a643e97abec4d01dfce48411101475c0705a98f29f3a8e3560fb0616"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-73382" :question/id #uuid "618fd74c-661c-5109-b46a-db4bc3813b3a" :question/math-academy-id "q-73382" :question/problem "Given that \n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}-x+4}{(x+2)^{3}}=\\frac{A}{x+2}+\\frac{B}{(x+2)^{2}}+\\frac{C}{(x+2)^{3}},\n$$\n\nwhere $A$, $B$ and $C$ are real constants, find the value of $A\\cdot B+C.$" :question/worked-solution "Multiplying both sides of the given equality by $(x+2)^{3}$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}-x+4 & =A(x+2)^{2}+B(x+2)+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLetting $x=-2$  gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(-2)^{2}-(-2)+4 & =A(-2+2)^{2}+B(-2+2)+C \\\\ 10 & =A(0)+B(0)+C \\\\ C & =10.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLetting $x=0$ and using our value for $C$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(0)^{2}-(0)+4 & =A(0+2)^{2}+B(0+2)+10 \\\\ 4 & =4A+2B+10 \\\\ 0 & =4A+2B+6 \\\\ 0 & =2A+B+3 \\\\ B & =-2A-3.\\,\\,(1)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, letting $x=-1$ and using our value for $C$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(-1)^{2}-(-1)+4 & =A(-1+2)^{2}+B(-1+2)+10 \\\\ 6 & =A+B+10 \\\\ 0 & =A+B+4 \\\\ B & =-4-A.\\,\\,(2)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom $(1)$ and $(2)$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2A-3 & =-4-A \\\\ -A & =-1 \\\\ A & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow we substitute the value of $A$ into $(2)$  to get the value of $B:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}B & =-4-1=-5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A\\cdot B+C & =1\\cdot (-5)+10 \\\\  & =-5+10 \\\\  & =5.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-73382/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9e9c4ef2-0491-5b42-8679-4fe7dfbd7b00"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-73382"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
